OL,4,CFBI reportedly investigating apparent  
OL,5,Chack of its criminal database          
OL,6,GThe FBI is investigating an apparent   
OL,7,Gbreach of its criminal information     
OL,8,Gdatabase, US media reports, citing two 
OL,9,Gpeople briefed on the issue.           
OL,11,FThe National Crime Information Center  
OL,12,F(NCIC) database is used by federal and 
OL,13,Flocal law enforcement to share         
OL,14,Finformation on warrants and background 
OL,15,Fchecks.                                
OL,17,FIt would not be the first time hackers 
OL,18,Fhave targeted the FBI, the domestic    
OL,19,Fintelligence and security service of   
OL,20,Fthe US. The agency did not respond to  
OL,21,Fthe BBC's request for comment.         
